title: 'hark ask intermittently fails before listen with Gemini TTS HTTP 400: model tried to generate text but should only be used for TTS. Ordinary planning questions trigger it under provider=auto/google; retrying a shorter prompt often works. Need provider fallback/retry so ask remains usable.'
